# #2340 finding 1, group rematerialization. A group policy change
# rematerializes its granted containers, and a rekey or revoke among them is a
# rotation like any other: one that would strand a level above a directly
# granted container is refused with `container_descendant_rekeys_required`
# naming the rekeys the batch must carry, so the policy error envelope gains
# that variant. Greenfield flag day: servers and every client are wiped and
# redeployed together, so no client written against the previous contract
# survives. Remove after merge to main.
